OL,3,GNEWSAMan charged with explosives
OL,4,Aoffences after police searches
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been charged with explosives
OL,7,Foffences after police seized suspicious
OL,8,Fitems during searches in west Belfast.
OL,10,FThe searches were carried out at
OL,11,Fproperties on the Shankill Road and
OL,12,FEdwina Street on Friday and Saturday.
OL,14,FThe suspect, who is 35, is due to
OL,15,Fappear at Belfast Magistrates' Court on
OL,16,FTuesday, accused of possessing
OL,17,Fexplosives and a prohibited weapon.
OL,23,APub: 31-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,420,410,260,120,0,100
