OL,3,GNEWSAMan charged with explosives
OL,4,Aoffences after police searches
OL,5,
OL,6,FDet Ch Insp McCallum of the Police
OL,7,FService of Northern Ireland said that
OL,8,Fresidents who were moved from their
OL,9,Fhomes "as a precaution" during the
OL,10,Fsecurity operation have since been
OL,11,Fallowed to return.
